WEBVTT

00:00:01.180 --> 00:00:08.350
Stepping out on
an ordinary Sunday

00:00:08.350 --> 00:00:14.860
Stepping out!
A miracle's gonna happen

00:00:14.860 --> 00:00:16.690
It's my day!

00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:27.270
Maybe I'll throw off my pajamas

00:00:29.740 --> 00:00:34.680
and head out to see her right now

00:00:36.650 --> 00:00:42.050
I always turned my eyes away,
thinking she'd hate me

00:00:43.720 --> 00:00:49.460
Now I'm saying goodbye
to that negative attitude

00:00:50.660 --> 00:00:55.230
My favorite shoes
will always take me

00:00:57.740 --> 00:01:02.370
To a place where I'll be happy

00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:09.880
It's not someone else
I want to embrace

00:01:11.580 --> 00:01:16.020
But a version of
myself that's not fake

00:01:16.020 --> 00:01:19.090
I just want to walk

00:01:19.420 --> 00:01:22.630
Not on tip-toe

00:01:22.860 --> 00:01:26.600
Not downcast, either

00:01:27.570 --> 00:01:35.510
Just I'm stepping out
on an ordinary Sunday

00:01:35.510 --> 00:01:41.950
Stepping out!
Making a little try, try, try

00:01:41.950 --> 00:01:44.220
It's my day!

00:01:57.160 --> 00:01:58.230
This is...

00:02:00.130 --> 00:02:02.370
...the most important woman in my life.

00:02:05.370 --> 00:02:08.710
<i>What are you saying, Domyoji?!
What are you saying?</i>

00:02:15.980 --> 00:02:18.020
<i>You're crazy!</i>

00:02:19.450 --> 00:02:21.920
<i>You're only speaking for yourself...</i>

00:02:23.020 --> 00:02:26.090
<i>What about me?
Do you care how I feel?</i>

00:02:26.960 --> 00:02:34.530
"Lovers on the Run?!"

00:02:46.710 --> 00:02:48.550
<i>Why do I have to put up
with this?</i>

00:02:49.780 --> 00:02:51.320
<i>I knew I shouldn't have come.</i>

00:02:51.980 --> 00:02:52.780
Tsukasa...

00:02:53.150 --> 00:02:57.260
You do know what it means,
for you to call her that?

00:03:00.690 --> 00:03:01.360
Yes.

00:03:02.630 --> 00:03:03.230
<i>Yes?!</i>

00:03:05.360 --> 00:03:07.570
Excuse me... H-Hold on, there!

00:03:08.630 --> 00:03:11.540
Auntie, she's a student with us
at Eitoku Academy.

00:03:11.870 --> 00:03:13.400
We're all the best of friends.

00:03:13.400 --> 00:03:14.910
There's nothing
to be suspicious of.

00:03:16.570 --> 00:03:18.140
You two stay out of this.

00:03:19.840 --> 00:03:23.380
I'm not asking whether or not
she's at all suspicious.

00:03:23.980 --> 00:03:27.320
I am asking whether she is fit to join
the Domyoji family or not.

00:03:28.550 --> 00:03:29.820
Forgive me.

00:03:32.690 --> 00:03:36.830
<i>One word from her shuts up the F4.
She must really be something.</i>

00:03:43.230 --> 00:03:44.840
What is your name?

00:03:46.100 --> 00:03:48.170
I-I'm Tsukushi Makino.

00:03:48.940 --> 00:03:52.210
Miss Makino...
I haven't heard of that name.

00:03:53.010 --> 00:03:55.680
What business is your father in?

00:03:56.380 --> 00:03:58.220
M-my father...

00:04:03.120 --> 00:04:04.360
Well...

00:04:05.420 --> 00:04:06.690
He's president of Makino & Co.

00:04:08.490 --> 00:04:09.260
He's the president.

00:04:09.860 --> 00:04:11.110
<i>President?!</i>

00:04:11.110 --> 00:04:13.450
<i>What are you saying, Rui Hanazawa?</i>

00:04:13.450 --> 00:04:15.030
Y-yes. That's right.

00:04:15.400 --> 00:04:16.470
<i>What?!</i>

00:04:16.470 --> 00:04:19.970
It's a foreign capital enterprise
that deals mainly in imports...

00:04:20.300 --> 00:04:22.840
It's listed on the stock market.
Haven't you heard of it?

00:04:23.640 --> 00:04:26.610
<i>Why are they making up a story
that she'll see right through?</i>

00:04:29.680 --> 00:04:32.950
Makino... Bluff your 
way through this for now.

00:04:34.190 --> 00:04:37.060
She has a lot of clout
in the financial world.

00:04:37.360 --> 00:04:39.690
She'll snuff out whomever
she has in her sights.

00:04:40.390 --> 00:04:42.730
Even if he's the
Prime Minister of Japan.

00:04:44.000 --> 00:04:45.760
S-snuff out?

00:04:52.340 --> 00:04:53.810
<i>Like mother...</i>

00:04:55.210 --> 00:04:56.370
<i>Like son...</i>

00:04:57.780 --> 00:05:00.680
Is that so? I suppose if you're
from such a family...

00:05:00.680 --> 00:05:03.880
...you'll be able to play
a musical instrument or two.

00:05:05.680 --> 00:05:08.090
Makino... Can you play the piano
or something?

00:05:08.390 --> 00:05:08.620
Pi...?

00:05:09.490 --> 00:05:13.170
Why don't you play a piece
for us this evening?

00:05:13.170 --> 00:05:14.460
Isn't that right, everyone?

00:05:17.300 --> 00:05:18.720
That would be wonderful.

00:05:18.720 --> 00:05:20.470
I'd love to hear her play.

00:05:20.470 --> 00:05:22.570
I'd like to hear a Brahms piece.

00:05:23.840 --> 00:05:25.440
How lovely!

00:05:26.440 --> 00:05:27.510
Oh, no...

00:05:34.550 --> 00:05:35.350
<i>Piano?</i>

00:05:39.980 --> 00:05:42.690
<i>I've never played such a thing!</i>

00:05:48.730 --> 00:05:50.730
Play whatever... Anything.

00:05:51.800 --> 00:05:53.300
Anything?!

00:05:54.200 --> 00:05:56.630
If I could, I'd play for you.

00:06:07.550 --> 00:06:10.420
<i>Domyoji... why aren't you
saying something?</i>

00:06:11.120 --> 00:06:14.320
<i>Don't make me embarrass myself
like this when I don't have to!</i>

00:06:16.850 --> 00:06:17.760
<i>Domyoji!</i>

00:06:22.160 --> 00:06:22.630
<i>Fine!</i>

00:06:24.800 --> 00:06:26.760
Mother, must you?

00:06:27.100 --> 00:06:29.270
You're putting her on the spot...
in front of all these people.

00:06:29.670 --> 00:06:33.240
Tsubaki. Any woman who marries
into the Domyoji family...

00:06:33.240 --> 00:06:36.110
...will eventually have to go out
into society.

00:06:37.110 --> 00:06:39.440
She should be confident enough
to handle any situation.

00:06:40.580 --> 00:06:41.510
<i>Marry into...?</i>

00:06:42.350 --> 00:06:44.550
Please, Miss Makino... Go ahead.

00:06:45.820 --> 00:06:48.990
<i>Is she joking?
It's not gonna happen.</i>

00:06:49.490 --> 00:06:52.690
<i>Even if I fell in love with Domyoji...</i>

00:06:52.990 --> 00:06:57.000
<i>I wouldn't want a woman like this
for a mother-in-law!</i>

00:07:30.460 --> 00:07:32.360
M-Makino!

00:07:39.140 --> 00:07:42.810
Uh... That jazz style's... very popular
in New York these days.

00:07:43.440 --> 00:07:45.080
She's really on the cutting edge.

00:07:57.120 --> 00:07:59.020
I knew it.

00:08:05.330 --> 00:08:08.400
What's the meaning of this, Tsukasa?

00:08:09.230 --> 00:08:12.500
You don't seem to understand
your position at all.

00:08:13.340 --> 00:08:16.710
Daughter of a company president?
I won't hear of this.

00:08:18.110 --> 00:08:20.780
She's not the daughter
of any company's president...

00:08:21.310 --> 00:08:22.710
...but it doesn't matter to me.

00:08:24.050 --> 00:08:27.490
Don't be ridiculous!
You are this family's heir!

00:08:28.450 --> 00:08:31.180
For you to have a boyish crush
on a little bug like her...

00:08:31.180 --> 00:08:33.320
How will I explain it to your father?!

00:08:33.320 --> 00:08:34.590
<i>A bug?!</i>

00:08:35.290 --> 00:08:36.460
Shut up, will you?

00:08:37.100 --> 00:08:38.660
What can I do? I love her.

00:08:39.930 --> 00:08:40.690
He said it!

00:08:40.690 --> 00:08:41.300
Phew...

00:08:44.670 --> 00:08:45.400
I love her.

00:08:51.180 --> 00:08:52.910
This is nothing to joke about.

00:08:54.110 --> 00:08:55.450
This is an order.

00:08:56.180 --> 00:08:58.920
You will not see this girl again!

00:09:02.320 --> 00:09:06.660
Please... Please stop!
We haven't even...

00:09:07.430 --> 00:09:08.490
Get out.

00:09:10.330 --> 00:09:14.580
Go on home.
This is a Domyoji family problem.

00:09:14.580 --> 00:09:17.040
You have no right to interrupt.

00:09:19.840 --> 00:09:21.540
Tsukasa. Go.

00:09:22.270 --> 00:09:22.940
Tsubaki?

00:09:23.510 --> 00:09:25.340
Leave the rest to me.

00:09:25.740 --> 00:09:26.640
Tsubaki!

00:09:27.510 --> 00:09:28.480
This is great!

00:09:30.320 --> 00:09:32.820
Tsukushi... I'm on your side.

00:09:33.820 --> 00:09:35.020
<i>On my side?</i>

00:09:36.090 --> 00:09:37.460
Thanks, Sis.

00:09:38.090 --> 00:09:39.260
Makino... Here's your bag.

00:09:41.990 --> 00:09:42.630
Good luck!

00:09:43.160 --> 00:09:46.000
Wait a minute!
I won't allow you to do this!

00:09:48.200 --> 00:09:49.770
Someone stop him!

00:09:58.940 --> 00:10:01.410
Don't touch me! You bastard!

00:10:43.760 --> 00:10:46.920
<i>Oh... My life is getting sucked up...</i>

00:10:47.530 --> 00:10:50.530
<i>in the huge whirlpool
of the Domyoji family...</i>

00:11:49.020 --> 00:11:50.450
<i>Please, Makino.</i>

00:11:50.450 --> 00:11:53.460
<i>You'll never be together anyway.</i>

00:12:04.970 --> 00:12:07.610
<i>Come with me. I'll introduce you
to my mother.</i>

00:12:17.380 --> 00:12:19.080
<i>It's Domyoji's mother...</i>

00:12:22.120 --> 00:12:24.260
<i>Who are you?</i>

00:12:30.960 --> 00:12:32.760
<i>Mother, this is...</i>

00:12:36.830 --> 00:12:38.770
...the most important woman
in my life.

00:12:40.940 --> 00:12:41.440
Huh...

00:12:46.410 --> 00:12:48.450
Tsukasa's finally grown up, huh.

00:12:49.950 --> 00:12:52.220
But man, what a day.

00:12:53.180 --> 00:12:56.420
I wonder what Tsukasa and Makino
are doing now.

00:12:56.890 --> 00:12:59.490
Well, Makino may be a bit slow
on the uptake,

00:12:59.490 --> 00:13:02.460
but after what Tsukasa said,
she might consider...

00:13:04.100 --> 00:13:05.760
Or maybe not.

00:13:11.470 --> 00:13:13.770
But, Tsukasa's mother...

00:13:14.510 --> 00:13:18.010
I've only met her three times,
but she hasn't changed at all.

00:13:18.710 --> 00:13:22.450
Remember what she said when we visited
during middle school?

00:13:29.590 --> 00:13:31.240
<i>Oh, hello.</i>

00:13:31.240 --> 00:13:32.120
<i>Hello.</i>

00:13:37.100 --> 00:13:38.300
<i>Tsukasa...</i>

00:13:40.130 --> 00:13:43.270
<i>if you insist on associating
with these boys...</i>

00:13:43.270 --> 00:13:45.770
Your brain will rot and melt away.

00:13:49.470 --> 00:13:54.510
She might hire a hit man
to kill Makino.

00:14:36.790 --> 00:14:38.790
Hey! Hey!

00:14:41.690 --> 00:14:43.290
Come on...

00:14:44.000 --> 00:14:45.030
Get up, will you?

00:14:46.530 --> 00:14:47.730
Ouch!

00:14:49.030 --> 00:14:50.570
You were snoring!

00:14:51.170 --> 00:14:52.370
You call yourself a girl?

00:14:53.200 --> 00:14:56.270
Snoring? That's a lie.
I was in shock...

00:14:56.810 --> 00:14:57.710
Shock?

00:14:58.440 --> 00:15:01.670
Oh, I get it... Yeah, your piano playing
<i>was</i> pretty bad.

00:15:01.670 --> 00:15:03.750
Dork! That's not why!

00:15:06.380 --> 00:15:08.890
Wait... We're moving.

00:15:13.960 --> 00:15:15.190
Where are we?

00:15:32.810 --> 00:15:37.690
This is familiar... Isn't this the yacht
we took to Atami?

00:15:37.690 --> 00:15:38.280
Yeah.

00:15:55.000 --> 00:15:58.800
This is where we ate squid with
all the silly Eitoku kids.

00:16:00.410 --> 00:16:03.070
That's right... Shizuka was here, too!

00:16:03.640 --> 00:16:06.240
We had a party on board. And...

00:16:23.860 --> 00:16:24.500
And...?

00:16:43.450 --> 00:16:45.020
<i>My first kiss with him!</i>

00:16:47.220 --> 00:16:48.190
What is it?

00:16:48.650 --> 00:16:49.990
N-nothing!

00:16:51.120 --> 00:16:53.730
It's chilly. I'm going back in.

00:16:54.390 --> 00:16:57.660
You'd never been 
kissed before then, right?

00:17:01.630 --> 00:17:05.070
Oh, shut up!
You stole that kiss! You thief!

00:17:05.970 --> 00:17:07.810
<i>You</i> ran into <i>me.</i>

00:17:09.170 --> 00:17:12.080
I want my first precious kiss back!

00:17:12.410 --> 00:17:14.610
Don't be silly. You should thank me.

00:17:15.110 --> 00:17:17.480
I'm going home.
Take me back to shore now.

00:17:18.180 --> 00:17:19.170
No way.

00:17:19.170 --> 00:17:20.120
No way?

00:17:21.420 --> 00:17:24.490
We've got to have
a knee-to-knee talk.

00:17:25.490 --> 00:17:26.790
Knee-to-knee?

00:17:27.560 --> 00:17:28.890
You mean heart-to-heart,
don't you?!

00:17:29.630 --> 00:17:32.060
Shut up! What's the diff?

00:17:32.360 --> 00:17:35.200
They're not the same! Not at all!

00:17:35.630 --> 00:17:38.200
Ah-ha! I'll bet you were thinking dirty!

00:17:38.200 --> 00:17:39.400
You jerk!

00:17:42.040 --> 00:17:44.310
<i>This isn't funny!</i>

00:17:44.910 --> 00:17:47.880
<i>Here I am, in the middle of nowhere,
with this beast...</i>

00:17:56.790 --> 00:17:59.290
M-my mom's gonna kill me...

00:17:59.760 --> 00:18:00.960
Grow up!

00:18:02.160 --> 00:18:02.980
What about you?!

00:18:02.980 --> 00:18:06.460
You're always acting so tough,
but you actually call her "Mother."

00:18:07.430 --> 00:18:09.200
We're not an ordinary family.

00:18:09.800 --> 00:18:12.440
I see my parents only once a year.

00:18:13.140 --> 00:18:14.240
Once a year?

00:18:15.840 --> 00:18:17.440
Since you were little,
for just a day?

00:18:18.040 --> 00:18:20.950
Yeah. Except on birthdays,
they're overseas.

00:18:21.810 --> 00:18:23.980
That's so weird!

00:18:24.380 --> 00:18:27.150
I can see your dad doing that,
but your mother, too?

00:18:27.950 --> 00:18:31.290
They had no choice.
My mom has a job, too.

00:18:34.960 --> 00:18:37.930
Have you heard of the Maple Hotels?

00:18:38.330 --> 00:18:41.780
Yes. I have... Even a poor girl like me
has heard of it.

00:18:41.780 --> 00:18:43.920
Of course I can't afford to stay there.

00:18:43.920 --> 00:18:46.800
But they're a global chain
of luxury hotels, right?

00:18:53.510 --> 00:18:57.320
<i>Kaede</i> means Maple, doesn't it?

00:18:57.320 --> 00:19:00.650
Yes. The hotels were named
after my mother.

00:19:01.050 --> 00:19:03.920
Really? Kaede Domyoji, then?

00:19:04.220 --> 00:19:07.230
Such a cute name...
for such a scary woman.

00:19:07.890 --> 00:19:09.530
Wow!

00:19:09.530 --> 00:19:12.530
Why are you so amazed by this stuff?
You're such a pain!

00:19:13.000 --> 00:19:15.700
But... your family owns hotels, too?

00:19:16.430 --> 00:19:18.450
My mom manages the hotels.

00:19:18.450 --> 00:19:20.770
That's why both my parents
are so busy.

00:19:21.770 --> 00:19:24.280
<i>I never realized he was that rich.</i>

00:19:25.010 --> 00:19:25.910
And so...

00:19:26.780 --> 00:19:29.080
We're like a family of strangers.

00:19:29.380 --> 00:19:33.280
I don't recall ever living together.
So we're all a little distant.

00:19:33.850 --> 00:19:36.990
I see... So that's 
why you act that way.

00:19:37.820 --> 00:19:40.750
Hey! Don't look so serious.

00:19:40.750 --> 00:19:41.790
But...

00:19:45.130 --> 00:19:48.670
Well, anyway...
Don't worry about my mother.

00:19:56.470 --> 00:20:00.310
I'll decide my own life.

00:20:10.860 --> 00:20:12.020
Oh, hey...

00:20:14.030 --> 00:20:17.160
Why don't you let this
determine your life?

00:20:29.140 --> 00:20:31.280
<i>Why is he so serious
all of a sudden?</i>

00:20:32.610 --> 00:20:37.980
<i>His life? I have nothing to do
with his life... do I?</i>

00:20:42.450 --> 00:20:43.450
<i>Is he serious?</i>

00:20:47.430 --> 00:20:49.990
This is everything we've found
on Tsukushi Makino.

00:20:50.760 --> 00:20:53.130
She is no daughter
of a company president.

00:20:53.530 --> 00:20:55.670
They're nothing but commoners.

00:20:59.100 --> 00:21:03.340
Her father is unemployed.
Her mother has a part-time job.

00:21:03.780 --> 00:21:06.840
But Tsukasa seems to be
quite infatuated with her.

00:21:07.210 --> 00:21:08.780
I've heard enough.

00:21:17.860 --> 00:21:18.920
In short...

00:21:20.220 --> 00:21:21.630
...here is what we must do.

00:21:23.590 --> 00:21:26.500
We've got to squish the bug quickly...

00:21:27.970 --> 00:21:30.640
before the Domyoji name
comes to further harm.

00:21:48.850 --> 00:21:51.430
I thought it might be a little early...

00:21:51.430 --> 00:21:53.830
But let us proceed
with the plan immediately.

00:21:58.030 --> 00:22:04.640
Will I ever make it that far?

00:22:04.640 --> 00:22:09.410
Yeah, I'm almost there.

00:22:11.210 --> 00:22:18.850
Some day, the whole world

00:22:18.850 --> 00:22:24.660
will have its eyes on me.

00:22:24.660 --> 00:22:32.430
Yeah, after our graduation ceremony

00:22:32.430 --> 00:22:38.040
we all wrote our dreams on the wall.

00:22:38.040 --> 00:22:44.680
A lot of time has passed since then

00:22:44.680 --> 00:22:51.050
but I'm just the same as I was on that day!

00:22:51.050 --> 00:22:57.960
Keep trying your best! 
Wishes can come true!

00:22:57.960 --> 00:23:06.830
Let's keep running down
 the road we believe in!

00:23:08.130 --> 00:23:14.740
Will I ever make it that far?

00:23:14.740 --> 00:23:20.810
Yeah, I'm almost there.

00:23:21.350 --> 00:23:28.090
Will I ever make it that far?

00:23:28.090 --> 00:23:31.460
Yeah, I'm almost there.

00:23:31.460 --> 00:23:37.330
I already made it this far, after all.

00:23:48.340 --> 00:23:51.510
I want Tsukushi to give up Tsukasa.

00:23:52.010 --> 00:23:53.180
Just a minute...

00:23:53.610 --> 00:23:56.380
You barge in on us, and
you don't know what's going on!

00:23:56.910 --> 00:23:59.080
It's your son who's after me.

00:24:00.180 --> 00:24:03.920
Something's going on behind my back.

00:24:04.720 --> 00:24:08.430
Hana Yori Dango:
"Tsukasa's Mother's Secret Plan"
